319
00:18:46,279 --> 00:18:47,839
Director Huang transferred a newcomer to our squad.

320
00:18:48,039 --> 00:18:49,079
Captain Lu and I discussed it,

321
00:18:49,240 --> 00:18:51,599
and we plan to have her shadow Zhuang Yan

322
00:18:51,799 --> 00:18:53,319
