332
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:20,920
I hope you're not here on a whim.

333
00:19:27,200 --> 00:19:29,000
I know the narcotics unit is a serious,

334
00:19:29,319 --> 00:19:30,440
very dangerous place.

335
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:32,880
I'm not doing this on a whim.

336
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:34,920
To transfer to narcotics,

337
