Of course, they're restructuring staff right now,

348
00:20:05,480 --> 00:20:06,799
so it could be a rumor

349
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:07,799
or a false accusation.

350
00:20:08,039 --> 00:20:09,559
But since we received a lead,

351
00:20:09,759 --> 00:20:10,960
we still have to look into it.

352
00:20:11,359 --> 00:20:12,400
You two head over there.

353
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:14,400
Under the guise of a spot check,

354
00:20:14,519 --> 00:20:17,359
