355
00:20:17,559 --> 00:20:17,960
Understood.

356
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,599
Here's the background info on Zhongtian Logistics.

357
00:20:22,799 --> 00:20:23,720
Got it. On our way.

358
00:20:28,839 --> 00:20:29,359
Not bad.

359
00:20:45,799 --> 00:20:46,400
