392
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:43,960
You're such a good big brother.

393
00:21:45,119 --> 00:21:45,720
Xinjie.

394
00:21:58,039 --> 00:21:59,960
There you are, bro.

395
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:03,319
You're...

396
00:22:05,440 --> 00:22:07,240
Brother Xiaokai.

397
00:22:07,799 --> 00:22:08,599
What's wrong, Xinjie?

398
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:12,440
Nothing's wrong. I'm fine.

399
00:22:12,559 --> 00:22:13,079
