400
00:22:13,279 --> 00:22:14,440
I'm fine. Totally fine, okay?

401
00:22:15,920 --> 00:22:17,519
Don't touch me!

402
00:22:17,599 --> 00:22:19,480
Leave me alone!

403
00:22:27,400 --> 00:22:28,279
This is my...

404
00:22:33,039 --> 00:22:34,039
Do you know what this is?

405
00:22:35,359 --> 00:22:36,559
Do you have any idea what this is?

406
00:22:36,759 --> 00:22:37,640
Give it back!

407
00:22:37,759 --> 00:22:38,480
Do you have any idea

408
00:22:38,519 --> 00:22:39,640
