409
00:22:40,480 --> 00:22:41,000
Give it back!

410
00:22:41,079 --> 00:22:42,359
I'm asking you. Where did you get this? Tell me!

411
00:22:42,599 --> 00:22:43,319
Where did it come from?

412
00:22:43,359 --> 00:22:43,720
Give it back!

413
00:22:43,880 --> 00:22:44,720
Where did you get it?

414
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:45,960
Are you giving it back or not?

415
00:22:46,000 --> 00:22:47,839
Tell me where you got this!

416
00:22:48,119 --> 00:22:52,160
Help! Someone is stealing my stuff!

417
00:22:53,079 --> 00:22:54,839
Xiaokai, what are you doing?

418
00:22:56,440 --> 00:22:57,400
What's going on here?

419
00:22:59,000 --> 00:22:59,480
What's this?

420
00:22:59,640 --> 00:23:00,240
Mind your own business!

421
00:23:00,839 --> 00:23:01,519
Drugs.

422
00:23:01,519 --> 00:23:02,440
Get out! Get out!

423
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:05,640
Xinjie...

424
00:23:05,680 --> 00:23:06,559
Zhao Xinjie, where did you get this stuff?

425
00:23:06,559 --> 00:23:07,359
I don't need you...

426
00:23:07,880 --> 00:23:10,119
How could you touch this stuff?

427
00:23:10,279 --> 00:23:11,200
Xinjie, did you hear me?

428
00:23:11,839 --> 00:23:13,680
Get out! Stay out of my life!

429
00:23:13,680 --> 00:23:14,519
Calm down!

430
00:23:14,920 --> 00:23:15,680
Where did you get it?

431
00:23:16,640 --> 00:23:17,240
Tell me!

432
00:23:18,119 --> 00:23:19,200
Where did it come from?

433
00:23:19,559 --> 00:23:20,839
I'll tell you!

434
00:23:21,200 --> 00:23:23,480
Back when we were at the club together,

435
00:23:23,680 --> 00:23:26,039
