437
00:23:28,759 --> 00:23:30,119
Don't think I didn't know!

438
00:23:30,319 --> 00:23:31,759
Stop putting on an act!

439
00:23:31,880 --> 00:23:33,079
You have no right to lecture me!

440
00:23:33,519 --> 00:23:35,039
You have no right to judge me!

441
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:36,720
Let go!

442
00:23:36,920 --> 00:23:38,400
You have no right to tell me what to do!

443
00:23:40,079 --> 00:23:40,960
Zhao Xinjie!

444
00:23:49,599 --> 00:23:50,720
These are the items

445
00:23:50,759 --> 00:23:52,440
