446
00:23:52,480 --> 00:23:54,920
They're all extremely rare medicines in Southeast Asia.

447
00:23:56,359 --> 00:23:57,200
Thank you, Mr. Ma.

448
00:23:58,359 --> 00:24:00,720
Our boss invites Mr. Ma over to his residence.

449
00:24:01,519 --> 00:24:02,000
Please.

450
00:24:02,200 --> 00:24:02,799
After you, Mr. Ma.

451
00:24:52,359 --> 00:24:53,240
Premium green tea

452
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:04,839
