456
00:25:11,160 --> 00:25:13,720
That truck is waiting specifically for this shipment.

457
00:25:14,319 --> 00:25:15,079
How many boxes in total?

458
00:25:15,480 --> 00:25:16,920
They're all here. 12 boxes in total.

459
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:17,640
12 boxes?

460
00:25:17,799 --> 00:25:18,279
Yes.

461
00:25:19,559 --> 00:25:20,119
What's wrong?

462
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:22,240
This brand of facial mask

463
00:25:22,319 --> 00:25:23,720
is sold directly online.

464
00:25:24,039 --> 00:25:25,319
They have their own official store.

465
00:25:25,759 --> 00:25:27,079
Normally, it's shipped from Beijing

466
00:25:27,119 --> 00:25:28,160
