473
00:25:47,839 --> 00:25:48,960
Open this up and let's check.

474
00:26:41,440 --> 00:26:42,279
There are so many of them.

475
00:26:42,799 --> 00:26:43,400
I'm in the warehouse.

476
00:26:43,480 --> 00:26:44,720
Too many people here. Hurry!

477
00:26:45,079 --> 00:26:45,640
Where the hell are you guys?

478
00:26:45,759 --> 00:26:47,119
Don't run around. Listen to me, follow me.

479
00:26:56,240 --> 00:26:57,160
Where is Zhao Xinjie?

480
