482
00:27:03,839 --> 00:27:04,920
Xinjie is my sister.

483
00:27:05,079 --> 00:27:06,200
Stay the hell away from her.

484
00:27:09,160 --> 00:27:11,039
Come out. I have questions for you.

485
00:27:11,200 --> 00:27:11,720
Who are you?

486
00:27:12,079 --> 00:27:13,160
Who are you? Why should I go out with you?

487
00:27:13,319 --> 00:27:13,680
Get lost!

488
00:27:16,839 --> 00:27:17,759
Let go of my boss!

489
00:27:18,279 --> 00:27:18,920
Let go!

490
00:27:22,400 --> 00:27:23,759
Come with me quietly.

491
00:27:25,519 --> 00:27:26,680
Don't ask for trouble, any of you.

492
00:27:39,519 --> 00:27:40,279
What the hell are you doing?

493
00:27:40,480 --> 00:27:41,319
Don't make me call the cops!

494
00:27:41,519 --> 00:27:43,240
When the cops get here, I'll tell them

495
00:27:43,640 --> 00:27:45,400
