496
00:27:48,839 --> 00:27:49,440
Ow, ow, ow!

497
00:27:49,599 --> 00:27:50,279
I'm leaving! I'm leaving!

498
00:27:50,279 --> 00:27:51,400
I'll leave, all right? I'm leaving!

499
00:27:52,039 --> 00:27:53,039
Take it easy, bro!

500
00:27:53,440 --> 00:27:53,880
I'm leaving!

501
00:27:57,279 --> 00:27:59,000
Bro, bro, I never crossed you, did I? Bro!

502
00:28:02,960 --> 00:28:03,799
Where is Zhao Xinjie?

503
00:28:04,160 --> 00:28:04,759
Zhao Xinjie?

504
00:28:05,039 --> 00:28:06,279
Who is Zhao Xinjie to you?

505
00:28:06,759 --> 00:28:07,839
I'm her brother.

506
00:28:08,559 --> 00:28:10,160
You're her brother, and you don't know where she is?

507
00:28:10,160 --> 00:28:10,920
How should I know?

508
00:28:12,759 --> 00:28:13,039
Bro—

509
00:28:14,039 --> 00:28:15,559
Who does Zhao Xinjie usually hang out with?

510
00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:17,039
Where did she get the drugs?

511
00:28:17,200 --> 00:28:17,759
Drugs?

512
00:28:18,240 --> 00:28:19,400
I really don't know about drugs, bro!

513
00:28:21,079 --> 00:28:21,799
I really don't know!

514
00:28:22,279 --> 00:28:23,160
Bro—

515
00:28:24,559 --> 00:28:25,759
When her cravings hit,

516
00:28:25,759 --> 00:28:27,160
