517
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:28,440
I... I don't know!

518
00:28:28,440 --> 00:28:29,119
I really don't know!

519
00:28:29,319 --> 00:28:30,240
I really don't know, bro!

520
00:28:32,519 --> 00:28:33,519
I'll talk! I'll talk! I'll talk!

521
00:28:33,640 --> 00:28:34,240
I'll talk! I'll talk!

522
00:28:34,599 --> 00:28:35,799
Let go, let go, let go! I'll talk!

523
00:29:07,200 --> 00:29:07,559
Please.

524
00:29:32,279 --> 00:29:32,640
Please,

525
00:29:35,160 --> 00:29:35,519
Boss,

526
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:37,279
