527
00:30:02,880 --> 00:30:03,279
Sir.

528
00:30:05,079 --> 00:30:05,839
Mr. Ma has arrived.

529
00:30:06,279 --> 00:30:06,680
All right.

530
00:30:08,079 --> 00:30:09,839
Mr. Theerade, an honor to meet you.

531
00:30:11,440 --> 00:30:13,200
Welcome, welcome. Please have a seat.

532
00:30:13,640 --> 00:30:14,160
After you.

533
00:30:18,519 --> 00:30:19,680
Mr. Qin mentioned

534
00:30:19,839 --> 00:30:21,440
