536
00:30:25,119 --> 00:30:27,079
I wonder how I might be of assistance?

537
00:30:28,279 --> 00:30:29,480
My wife and I

538
00:30:29,680 --> 00:30:32,079
really love the culture of Country M,

539
00:30:32,240 --> 00:30:33,359
so we're planning

540
00:30:33,359 --> 00:30:35,079
to purchase a property here

541
00:30:35,799 --> 00:30:37,559
