549
00:30:50,559 --> 00:30:51,559
Thank you, Mr. Theerade.

550
00:30:52,559 --> 00:30:55,079
Because I frequently move cargo

551
00:30:55,279 --> 00:30:56,240
back and forth between both regions,

552
00:30:56,839 --> 00:30:57,720
