557
00:31:07,799 --> 00:31:10,039
I wondered if you might lend a hand.

558
00:31:11,039 --> 00:31:13,400
"Know the land to win; choose the land to profit."

559
00:31:13,759 --> 00:31:15,119
That Mr. Ma grasps such principles,

560
00:31:15,119 --> 00:31:16,079
I quite admire.

561
00:31:17,680 --> 00:31:20,039
However, I mainly deal in tourism in Country M,

562
00:31:20,119 --> 00:31:21,880
while Mr. Ma is in trade.

563
00:31:22,559 --> 00:31:24,519
I'm afraid I may not be of much help.

564
00:31:29,240 --> 00:31:31,559
As they say, character precedes business.

565
00:31:32,279 --> 00:31:34,240
Mr. Ma is new in town,

566
00:31:34,720 --> 00:31:36,079
and this is only our first meeting.

567
00:31:36,079 --> 00:31:38,079
Talking business now is likely premature.

568
00:31:38,480 --> 00:31:39,599
Still, since you've come, Mr. Ma,

569
00:31:39,599 --> 00:31:40,720
you are my guest.

570
00:31:42,119 --> 00:31:44,079
Arrange a hotel for Mr. Ma,

571
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:47,119
and show him around over the next few days.

572
00:31:47,680 --> 00:31:48,039
Yes, sir.

573
00:31:49,880 --> 00:31:50,759
Mr. Theerade—

574
00:31:50,920 --> 00:31:51,559
Look, Mr. Ma.

575
00:31:52,519 --> 00:31:54,880
Since Mr. Theerade has already made arrangements,

576
00:31:55,240 --> 00:31:56,720
let's follow our host's lead.

577
00:31:59,440 --> 00:32:01,640
Then we won't trouble Mr. Theerade any further.

578
00:32:03,920 --> 00:32:04,400
Thank you.

579
00:32:05,519 --> 00:32:05,839
Goodbye.

580
00:32:26,039 --> 00:32:27,200
They were all produced last month.

581
00:32:28,079 --> 00:32:28,720
Old stock?

582
00:32:31,079 --> 00:32:32,720
If this Gao Min runs a beauty salon,

583
00:32:32,880 --> 00:32:34,559
then it all makes sense.

584
00:32:38,480 --> 00:32:39,400
380 grams.

585
00:32:44,400 --> 00:32:45,720
There's definitely more than 380 grams here.

586
00:33:00,319 --> 00:33:00,839
Heroin.

587
00:33:02,599 --> 00:33:04,680
None of today's shipments are going out.

588
00:33:05,079 --> 00:33:06,720
All personnel must wait to be inspected.

589
00:33:07,400 --> 00:33:08,119
Understood. Right away.

590
00:33:16,240 --> 00:33:19,759
What is Mr. Theerade really up to?

591
00:33:21,880 --> 00:33:23,720
Theerade is a very shrewd man.

592
00:33:24,480 --> 00:33:26,000
I've dealt with him for over three years,

593
00:33:26,000 --> 00:33:27,480
and he still doesn't fully trust me.

594
00:33:28,319 --> 00:33:30,240
Let alone a newcomer like you.

595
00:33:30,920 --> 00:33:32,720
Still, you're smart, Mr. Ma.

596
00:33:33,279 --> 00:33:34,720
You brought what he needed.

597
00:33:35,440 --> 00:33:37,720
It's clear he likes you.

598
00:33:39,880 --> 00:33:40,200
By the way,

599
00:33:40,559 --> 00:33:42,720
how did you know that near Jiechan State,

600
00:33:43,000 --> 00:33:44,319
a new strain of malaria would break out?

601
00:33:45,799 --> 00:33:47,480
To meet with Mr. Theerade,

602
00:33:48,079 --> 00:33:50,000
one must come prepared.

603
00:33:50,640 --> 00:33:51,640
Know who you're dealing with.

604
00:33:53,720 --> 00:33:54,279
Mr. Qin,

605
00:33:55,039 --> 00:33:56,480
this Mr. Theerade—

606
00:33:56,640 --> 00:33:57,839
how does he speak such fluent Chinese?

607
00:33:59,480 --> 00:34:01,319
He's had quite a legendary life.

608
00:34:02,000 --> 00:34:03,480
Theerade is originally of Chinese descent.

609
00:34:03,759 --> 00:34:04,799
Decades ago,

610
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:07,119
his mother remarried and moved here.

611
00:34:07,359 --> 00:34:08,800
So he came along with her.

612
00:34:09,400 --> 00:34:10,559
A few years ago, his stepfather

613
00:34:10,760 --> 00:34:12,639
tragically died in a car accident.

614
00:34:13,239 --> 00:34:15,159
So he took over the family business.

615
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:16,519
A few years later,

616
00:34:16,519 --> 00:34:18,880
he became a prominent businessman in Country M.

617
00:34:22,199 --> 00:34:24,159
Then how does Mr. Theerade

618
00:34:25,159 --> 00:34:28,519
stand with Country M's Four Great Families?

619
00:34:28,719 --> 00:34:29,440
How should I put it?

620
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:32,719
On the surface, things seem calm.

621
00:34:33,519 --> 00:34:34,760
In our line of work,

622
00:34:35,199 --> 00:34:36,159
can anyone really avoid conflict?

623
00:34:36,840 --> 00:34:38,000
Still,

624
00:34:38,480 --> 00:34:39,599
this man

625
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:41,719
has solid ties with the business community

626
00:34:41,719 --> 00:34:43,440
and police in Country M.

627
00:34:43,840 --> 00:34:46,400
So if you want to move goods from Country M to the mainland,

628
00:34:46,679 --> 00:34:47,599
partnering with him

629
00:34:48,599 --> 00:34:49,599
is still your safest bet.

630
00:35:31,840 --> 00:35:33,400
It's so late.

631
00:35:34,079 --> 00:35:36,079
Who'd be looking for you?

632
00:35:36,960 --> 00:35:37,679
Let me check.

633
00:35:53,800 --> 00:35:54,480
Who is it?

634
00:35:54,840 --> 00:35:56,480
Hello, gas company.

635
00:35:56,920 --> 00:35:58,559
A neighbor reported a gas leak in your unit.

636
00:36:14,440 --> 00:36:16,440
Police! Run!

637
00:36:23,400 --> 00:36:24,079
Hello?

638
00:36:24,639 --> 00:36:26,239
A gas leak is a serious matter.

639
00:36:26,719 --> 00:36:27,800
Please hurry up.

640
00:36:35,000 --> 00:36:36,480
Hold on, I'm getting dressed.

641
00:36:37,760 --> 00:36:38,079
Over here.

642
00:36:48,320 --> 00:36:49,599
Don't move! Don't move!

643
00:36:50,800 --> 00:36:51,239
Get out!

644
00:36:52,800 --> 00:36:53,360
Cuff him!

645
00:37:04,079 --> 00:37:05,079
The suspect jumped and fled!

646
00:37:05,280 --> 00:37:06,599
Team B, pursue immediately!

647
00:37:16,320 --> 00:37:17,199
Did you get the license plate?

648
00:37:17,719 --> 00:37:19,360
Black Honda, ending in 479.

649
00:37:20,159 --> 00:37:20,760
Team B! Team B!

650
00:37:21,280 --> 00:37:22,800
Suspect vehicle is a black Honda,

651
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:23,840
plate ending in 479.

652
00:37:24,400 --> 00:37:25,519
Contact traffic control right away.

653
00:37:31,519 --> 00:37:32,639
Inside this shipment of facial masks,

654
00:37:32,639 --> 00:37:34,679
a total of 1.5 kilograms of heroin was seized.

655
00:37:35,480 --> 00:37:36,440
The consignee is Gao Min,

656
00:37:36,800 --> 00:37:38,119
who runs a beauty salon.

657
00:37:38,760 --> 00:37:40,119
According to logistics records,

658
00:37:40,760 --> 00:37:41,760
over the past three months,

659
00:37:42,159 --> 00:37:44,039
Gao Min received three shipments of the same brand.

660
00:37:44,440 --> 00:37:47,039
And all of them were sent from Jiangyang.

661
00:37:48,159 --> 00:37:49,960
The sender is Xinghai Trading,

662
00:37:50,760 --> 00:37:51,639
a small-scale company.

663
00:37:51,880 --> 00:37:53,199
The legal representative is Cheng Weimin.

664
00:37:55,960 --> 00:37:57,519
We've contacted the Jiangyang police.

665
00:37:57,800 --> 00:37:59,000
Regarding Xinghai Trading,

666
00:37:59,000 --> 00:38:00,039
they've launched an urgent investigation.

667
00:38:00,119 --> 00:38:00,880
Ever since this afternoon,

668
00:38:01,159 --> 00:38:02,639
when the masks were intercepted,

669
00:38:02,880 --> 00:38:04,239
Cheng Weimin has gone missing.

670
00:38:04,840 --> 00:38:05,960
We now suspect

671
00:38:06,400 --> 00:38:07,519
that inside this logistics company,

672
00:38:07,760 --> 00:38:09,039
there's an informant for the drug cartel.

673
00:38:11,079 --> 00:38:12,199
As for Cheng Weimin,

674
00:38:12,480 --> 00:38:13,320
we haven't found

675
00:38:13,320 --> 00:38:14,679
any criminal record on him yet.

676
00:38:15,519 --> 00:38:17,280
The suspect Gao Min is in custody,

677
00:38:17,519 --> 00:38:18,199
awaiting interrogation.

678
00:38:21,639 --> 00:38:22,599
What about the other suspect?

679
00:38:23,519 --> 00:38:24,199
Any news?

680
00:38:24,599 --> 00:38:25,960
During the previous interrogation,

681
00:38:26,320 --> 00:38:28,000
Gao Min refused to talk.

682
00:38:29,000 --> 00:38:30,440
As for the suspects on the run,

683
00:38:30,639 --> 00:38:31,400
we don't have

684
00:38:31,400 --> 00:38:32,599
any other useful leads.

685
00:38:36,239 --> 00:38:36,519
Captain,

686
00:38:37,920 --> 00:38:40,199
it was my oversight during the operation

687
00:38:40,960 --> 00:38:42,199
that let the suspect get away.

688
00:38:43,480 --> 00:38:44,519
I take full responsibility.

689
00:38:51,199 --> 00:38:53,880
What oversight are you talking about?

690
00:38:54,920 --> 00:38:56,119
I tried to be clever

691
00:38:56,960 --> 00:38:58,119
and used a gas leak excuse

692
00:38:59,000 --> 00:39:00,159
to get the suspect to open the door.

693
00:39:00,440 --> 00:39:02,119
Turned out it was a commercial property,

694
00:39:02,639 --> 00:39:03,480
a serviced apartment.

695
00:39:04,159 --> 00:39:05,079
There's no gas line.

696
00:39:12,320 --> 00:39:13,519
Being able to spot your mistake

697
00:39:14,360 --> 00:39:15,320
and admit it

698
00:39:15,719 --> 00:39:16,840
shows you're improving.

699
00:39:17,320 --> 00:39:18,480
As your superior,

700
00:39:19,000 --> 00:39:19,880
I give you credit for that.

701
00:39:22,400 --> 00:39:23,440
Let's interrogate Gao Min.

702
00:39:23,880 --> 00:39:24,679
Press her through the night

703
00:39:24,880 --> 00:39:27,280
to see if we can get any valuable leads.

704
00:39:27,719 --> 00:39:28,159
Yes, sir.

705
00:39:36,960 --> 00:39:38,599
Bro, I already told you.

706
00:39:38,599 --> 00:39:40,199
To find Xinjie, you have to find Xu Na first.

707
00:39:40,440 --> 00:39:42,199
They're besties and hang out all the time.

708
00:39:43,079 --> 00:39:44,320
And the one who got Xinjie hooked on heroin

709
00:39:44,320 --> 00:39:45,239
was that woman!

710
00:39:45,639 --> 00:39:46,960
I warned Xinjie a long time ago

711
00:39:47,119 --> 00:39:48,599
not to hang out with someone like her.

712
00:39:49,440 --> 00:39:50,920
Friends like that are nothing but trouble!

713
00:39:54,400 --> 00:39:56,360
Ac-Actually, I tried to stop Xinjie,

714
00:39:56,480 --> 00:39:57,519
but do you know what she said?

715
00:39:57,800 --> 00:39:59,760
She told everyone to mind their own business.

716
00:40:00,039 --> 00:40:00,760
By the way, Bro,

717
00:40:01,559 --> 00:40:03,159
when you go to the club to look for Xu Na,

718
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:05,239
whatever you do, don't say I brought you.

719
00:40:05,639 --> 00:40:06,519
That woman,

720
00:40:06,679 --> 00:40:08,239
she has a guy at the club named

721
00:40:08,760 --> 00:40:10,199
Brother Biao backing her up.

722
00:40:10,760 --> 00:40:12,280
Brother Biao has so many lackeys under him.

723
00:40:13,000 --> 00:40:14,280
Going there alone to demand someone...

724
00:40:14,800 --> 00:40:15,920
You've got to be careful!

725
00:40:35,559 --> 00:40:35,800
Get out of the car.

726
00:40:36,159 --> 00:40:37,440
Bro, aren't you going in alone?

727
00:40:38,199 --> 00:40:39,000
No, no, no! Bro, bro!

728
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:39,920
Don't drag me with you, bro!

729
00:40:40,440 --> 00:40:41,800
This place isn't for me, bro! Don't!

730
00:40:57,920 --> 00:41:00,440
I call the shots here.

731
00:41:03,880 --> 00:41:05,119
Brother Wei, Brother Wei.

732
00:41:05,920 --> 00:41:06,920
Is Sister Na around?

733
00:41:07,159 --> 00:41:07,800
Someone's looking for her.

734
00:41:08,280 --> 00:41:08,840
Who?

735
00:41:09,400 --> 00:41:10,360
That guy over there.

736
00:41:10,480 --> 00:41:11,599
Says Zhao Xinjie is his sister.

737
00:41:11,679 --> 00:41:12,800
And she's close with Sister Na.

738
00:41:13,000 --> 00:41:14,360
So I brought him over.

739
00:41:14,559 --> 00:41:15,800
Cut the sister crap.

740
00:41:16,039 --> 00:41:16,440
Beat it!

741
00:41:20,000 --> 00:41:21,519
Bro, Xu Na isn't here. Let's go.

742
00:41:25,719 --> 00:41:26,360
Where is Xu Na?

743
00:41:29,199 --> 00:41:30,079
Who the hell are you?

744
00:41:32,119 --> 00:41:33,519
I asked you, where is Xu Na?

745
00:41:34,480 --> 00:41:34,800
Scram!

746
00:41:36,239 --> 00:41:36,719
Get lost!

747
00:41:37,320 --> 00:41:37,679
I...

748
00:41:39,559 --> 00:41:40,559
Brother Wei, Brother Wei!

749
00:42:02,760 --> 00:42:04,199
Come on!

750
00:42:04,400 --> 00:42:04,920
Cheers!

751
00:42:04,920 --> 00:42:06,239
Come on, drink up!

752
00:42:06,280 --> 00:42:06,480
Let's get wild!

753
00:42:09,960 --> 00:42:10,480
Turn it up!

754
00:42:10,480 --> 00:42:11,000
Brother Biao.

755
00:42:11,320 --> 00:42:12,840
Someone outside is looking for Sister Na.

756
00:42:12,840 --> 00:42:13,920
He's fighting our guys.

757
00:42:14,360 --> 00:42:15,559
It's just one guy, what are you scared of?

758
00:42:15,559 --> 00:42:16,239
Tell him to get lost.

759
00:42:16,400 --> 00:42:18,000
But Brother Wei and the guys can't take him!

760
00:42:21,880 --> 00:42:22,559
Someone's looking for you.

761
00:42:23,719 --> 00:42:24,280
I'll go check.

762
00:42:25,119 --> 00:42:25,920
Okay, go ahead.

763
00:42:28,800 --> 00:42:29,800
Come on, let's keep going.

764
00:42:34,800 --> 00:42:35,639
Stop!

765
00:42:44,159 --> 00:42:44,840
Brother Biao!

766
00:42:46,320 --> 00:42:47,360
He's here to trash the place!

767
00:42:47,360 --> 00:42:48,679
Shut up!

768
00:42:52,760 --> 00:42:53,440
Who are you?

769
00:42:53,880 --> 00:42:54,719
I'm looking for Xu Na.

770
00:42:55,360 --> 00:42:56,239
To ask where my sister is.

771
00:42:56,599 --> 00:42:57,199
Looking for who?

772
00:42:57,960 --> 00:42:58,719
Looking for Xu Na.

773
00:43:01,320 --> 00:43:02,039
Looking for Xu Na?

774
00:43:02,880 --> 00:43:04,079
Xu Na is my girl.

775
00:43:05,320 --> 00:43:05,719
Come on.

776
00:43:08,519 --> 00:43:09,199
Come on.
